# Adult ADHD screen — Barkley-only reference

Route: `/test/adhd-adult-screening`  
Policy: `docs/ADHD_SCREENING_REFERENCE.md`

## Sole source

When writing or answering questions, scoring meaning, domain tips, or individual report copy for this screen, use **only**:

> Barkley, R. A. (Ed.). *Attention-Deficit Hyperactivity Disorder: A Handbook for Diagnosis and Treatment* (4th ed.). Guilford Press.

Local PDF (never commit): Desktop file named `ADHD, Fourth Edition A Handbook for Diagnosis and Treatment (Russell A. Barkley)...pdf`

## Do

- Ground domains in Barkley themes: inattention, hyperactivity, impulsivity, executive self-regulation, emotional dysregulation, time/motivation & follow-through
- Prefer adult / EF / emotion / assessment chapters (esp. 2, 3, 10, 12, 13, 16, 19)
- Keep items and reports **original educational wording**

## Do not

- Cite or import content from other ADHD books, blogs, or competing models for this screen
- Copy BAARS-IV, BDEFS, or any copyrighted scale item text into code or UI
- Paste handbook chapters into customer-facing reports
- Claim diagnosis or replace licensed clinical assessment
